</section><section class="section section--white ev-facts"><div class="container"><dl class="ev-facts__list" data-seq><div class="ev-fact" data-reveal><dt>Where</dt><dd>Cambodia</dd></div><div class="ev-fact" data-reveal><dt>When</dt><dd>February 2025</dd></div><div class="ev-fact" data-reveal><dt>CMA coaches</dt><dd>26</dd></div><div class="ev-fact" data-reveal><dt>Young leaders</dt><dd>120</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="section ev-story"><div class="container"><div class="ev-story__col"><h2 data-reveal>Putting Our Belief in People <em class="hl">into Action</em></h2><p data-reveal>What our coaches choose to do with their skills says something important about who we are as a community.</p><p data-reveal>In February 2025, 26 CMA coaches came together in Cambodia to support 120 young leaders through the <strong>I Am NOT Afraid Camp</strong>. They brought their professional experience and a shared conviction that young people deserve opportunities to discover their strengths, recognise their potential and take greater ownership of their lives.</p><p data-reveal>Through personal leadership workshops, practical learning sessions, creative activities and group coaching, participants explored who they were becoming and what they wanted for their future. They examined how they responded to challenges, recognised strengths they could draw upon and began developing personal blueprints for the lives they wished to create.</p><p data-reveal>At the heart of this experience was a belief central to CMA's approach to transformational coaching: <strong>meaningful change must belong to the person experiencing it.</strong></p><p data-reveal>Confidence cannot simply be given to someone. It develops as people recognise their own capabilities, discover new possibilities and begin to trust their capacity to make choices.</p><p data-reveal>Throughout the camp, we witnessed moments of courage, growing self-belief and young people beginning to see themselves and their futures differently. These experiences reminded us of the significance a meaningful conversation can have, particularly when someone feels genuinely heard, understood and encouraged to explore what might be possible.</p><p data-reveal>The coaches found themselves equally enriched by the experience.</p><figure class="sf-quote ev-quote" data-reveal><i class="sf-quote__rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><blockquote class="sf-quote__text">“In giving, we also receive,” reflected one participating coach.</blockquote></figure><p data-reveal>They came to contribute their time, knowledge and experience. Yet the young people's stories, courage and aspirations offered fresh perspectives and renewed their own sense of purpose. The experience became one of learning and growth in both directions.</p><p class="sf-lead" data-reveal>This is the kind of community we are committed to building at CMA.</p><p data-reveal>People who continually deepen their professional mastery and willingly use their capabilities to contribute to the lives of others.</p><p data-reveal>The Cambodia initiative reflects what becomes possible when a community of coaches acts together on what it believes.</p></div></div></section><section class="section section--surface ev-media"><div class="container"><div class="ev-story__col"><div class="video-card ev-video" data-reveal="scale"><img src="{{ asset('assets/img/sf-i-am-not-afraid-video.jpg') }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><a class="video-card__play" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=194TgmaGq60" data-video aria-label="Play video"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></a><p class="ev-video__label">I Am NOT Afraid Camp 2025, Cambodia</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section section--green sf-band sf-band--closing"><div class="container"><p class="ev-closing" data-reveal>For CMA, <strong>helping people change better is a commitment we carry beyond our training programmes and into the world.</strong></p></div></section><section class="section section--white sf-events"><div class="container"><div class="sf-events__grid sf-events__grid--one"><a class="card sf-event" href="{{ url('/pages/our-social-foundation/dare-to-dream') }}" data-reveal><p class="sf-event__meta"><span>Colombo, Sri Lanka</span> <span class="ev-meta__sep">|</span> <span>February 2026</span></p><h3>Dare to Dream</h3><p class="sf-event__sub">A Future Beyond the Expected</p><span class="link">Read the story<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8"/></svg></span></a><a class="card sf-event sf-event--back" href="{{ url('/pages/our-social-foundation') }}" data-reveal><p class="sf-event__meta"><span>About Us</span></p><h3>Our Social Foundation</h3><span class="link">Back to the page<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8"/></svg></span></a></div></div></section>
